; The hibiscus tree's sphere version (2026-09-29, her "build both versions"): a
; leafy ball with a saucer of leaves over its top third, its brim flared out,
; the hibiscus's flowers, on the azalea sphere tree's barked trunk, about 2.3 m
; tall. The shape is `assets/source/props/hibiscus_tree_sphere.blend`; Send to
; game writes the GLB. `bloom`, `size` and `season` work as on the hibiscus
; shrub. Visual only.

